<title>POLAND: Chemiskor sees PLN 2.5 mln net in 1997.</title>
<headline>Chemiskor sees PLN 2.5 mln net in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish leather company Chemiskor SA forecasts that its net profit will increase to 2.5 million zlotys this year from 660,000 zlotys in 1996, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Earlier this year, Chemiskor forecast the 1997 net profit at 1.3 million zlotys. The firm's statement contained no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
